n="left">KGY843</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>cdc13</italic>-117 <italic>ura4</italic>-D18 <italic>leu1</italic>-32 <italic>ade6</italic>-M210</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">P. Nurse</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY858</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h<sup>&#x0002b;</sup><italic>dim1::ura4</italic><sup>&#x0002b;</sup> carrying pKG718 <italic>ura4</italic>-D18 <italic>leu1</italic>-32 <italic>ade6</italic>-M216</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY872</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>cdc25</italic>-22 <italic>dim1</italic>-35 <italic>his3</italic>-D1 <italic>ura4</italic>-D18 <italic>leu1</italic>-32 <italic>ade6</italic>-M210</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY874</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h<sup>&#x0002b;</sup><italic>cdc13</italic>-117 <italic>dim1</italic>-35 <italic>ura4</italic>-D18 <italic>leu1</italic>-32 <italic>ade6</italic>-M210</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY878</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>cdc2</italic>-22 <italic>dim1</italic>-35</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY879</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>dim1</italic>-35 <italic>cdc</italic>13-A381V</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY895</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>dim1</italic>-35 <italic>cdr1</italic>-76</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY896</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>cdc2</italic>-D217N <italic>dim1</italic>-35</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">This study</td></tr><tr><td align="left">KGY939</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">h- <italic>cut1</italic>-RB5 <italic>ura4</italic>-D18 <italic>leu1</italic>-32</td><td align="left"/><td align="left">I. Hagan<xref ref-type